SOLUTION 1
    pH      7.0
    temp    25.0
    units   mol/L
    Ca      0.01
    Sr      0.01
    Alkalinity 0.04

SOLID_SOLUTIONS 1
    Ca_Sr_carbonate
        comp1   Calcite       0.0
        comp2   Strontianite  0.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           solid_solution3.out
    -reset          false
    -solid_solutions true

END
